 ScenarioA;chunk;n;nearest;new_words

⍝ In this scenario, we simulate the concurrent addition of hundreds of words and searching at the same time.
⍝ As written, the system errors while attempting to add or search for words.

 WORDS←''
 DIST←0 0⍴0

 new_words←⊃⎕NGET'WordSearch/dict.txt' 1   ⍝ Nested vector of words

 n←10   ⍝ Number of simultaneous AddWord requests
 nearest←''
 responses←''
 :While 0<≢new_words
     chunk←n↑new_words
     {}AddWord&¨chunks          ⍝ Add many words
     nearest,←⎕TSYNC Search&∘⊃¨chunks   ⍝ ...while searching the index
     new_words↓⍨←n
 :EndWhile
 ⎕←≢nearest

⍝ Check correctness
 result←'FAIL' 'PASS'⊃⍨⎕IO+WORDS≡⍥{⍵[⍋⍵]}new_words
 ⎕←'All words successfully added: ',result
